  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/46920350), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/wicked_cc), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/vicious_cottoncandy), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2984721), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230139), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/8104)  \n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0CKBTQG36/) \n\n\"Let's see. I'm going to be a really nice woman. I told you before. I'm not the type to live like this.\"\n\n Here is a woman who has been betrayed by life and fed up with men!  \n She looks at the shoes in the shop window and dreams of her happiness.  \n The reality she is in is hell.\n\n I want to live a new life only for the happiness of 'me'  \n Her golden opportunity came to her with her mind!!\n\n 300 million won in your hands if you fake marriage with gay Hyun-soo?\n\n No more men!  \n The story of a woman who reacts most passionately to her own life more than anything else.",
